''life is sometimes an illusion. Listen to your heart. Not your head.''

We've talked now, I don't mind which you use! [[User:Aeralys|Aeralys]] ([[User talk:Aeralys|talk]]) 03:21, November 7, 2016 (UTC)

I love you &lt;3. 



ᵉᵛᵉʳʸ ᵍᵒᵈᵈᵉˢˢ ᶦⁿ ᵗʰᶦˢ ᵘⁿᶦᵛᵉʳˢᵉ 05:04, November 7, 2016 (UTC)

