------------------------------------------&lt;br /&gt;Let's assume one considers themselves an awoken and/or enlightened mage after facing one's inner Balrog and emerging in a white robe... how would one get in contact with the real Cicada 3301 if one lacks literacy regarding code and encryption?

I imagine a cicada village can't consist soley of fishermen who say "we can all fish so we have all that we really need". Surely, there must be a place for carpenters and bards and gatekeepers and many other trades in a civilized group which understands the art of trade and communication...

So how does a mage who is not literate in code language make proper contact?&lt;br /&gt;Based on what I understand about Cicada 3301 from the already decoded pages of the Liber Primus our interests are aligned and I want to be part of the emergence when one day the cicada sing for real.

Blessings from a one-eyed wanderer who walked miles and miles in the shoes of giants.

